#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"Imagine a property manager overseeing multiple units. With traditional keys,"
" retrieving and tracking keys for every tenant or maintenance worker can be "
"a challenge. SmartphoneKey simplifies this process with non-copyable key "
"cards and digital wallet access. When a tenant moves out, the property "
"manager can instantly deactivate their access without needing to change "
"locks or track down keys. This ensures that each unit remains secure, with "
"full control over who can enter."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.team.member,bio:spk_website_v2.team_kate_vasylenko
msgid ""
"In 2015, Kate founded 42DM to provide tech companies with tailored marketing"
" strategies and a highly skilled team capable of navigating the challenges "
"of the US and international markets. Throughout her career, she has "
"supported over 100 B2B tech companies in North America and Europe, "
"leveraging her expertise in demand generation, ABM, inbound marketing, and "
"marketing operations. Her approach combines traditional consulting with "
"cutting-edge marketing techniques to help businesses achieve significant "
"milestones, including unicorn status, successful exits, and IPOs."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model:spk.website.resource,direct_answer:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"In an era where security is paramount, SmartphoneKey is redefining what "
"access control can do. Unlike traditional keys, which can easily be lost or "
"duplicated, SmartphoneKey offers advanced security features tailored for "
"modern needs."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"In an era where security is paramount, SmartphoneKey is redefining what "
"access control can do. Unlike traditional keys, which can easily be lost or "
"duplicated, SmartphoneKey offers advanced security features tailored for "
"modern needs. From <strong>non-copyable key cards</strong> to "
"<strong>digital keys</strong> stored in your <strong>Apple or Google "
"Wallet</strong>, SmartphoneKey ensures your property is secure and access is"
" always controlled. Here’s how SmartphoneKey elevates security for property "
"managers, homeowners, and businesses alike."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.team.member,bio:spk_website_v2.team_denys_merkulov
msgid ""
"In his role as CTO at SmartphoneKey, Denys drives the technological vision, "
"ensuring the integration of cutting-edge solutions across product "
"development, manufacturing processes, and logistics operations. He is "
"committed to enhancing operational efficiency, scalability, and quality "
"assurance, laying the foundation for sustainable growth and technological "
"excellence. Denys continuously seeks innovative methods to elevate "
"operational performance, solidifying SmartphoneKey's position as a leader in"
" smart access technology."
msgstr ""

