"restricted, or full access</strong> to residents, guests, and service "
"providers, ensuring a secure yet flexible system for shared spaces."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_smart_home_trends_2025_the_future_of_secure_and_connected_living
msgid ""
"With SmartphoneKey, users can <strong>unlock doors without an app, reducing "
"dependency on smartphones while ensuring security.</strong> No more lost "
"keys, forgotten passcodes, or unauthorized key copies—just seamless, secure "
"entry."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
"With SmartphoneKey, you can provide secure, keyless access that keeps your "
"property protected and gives you complete control."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.resource,body:spk_website_v2.post_how_smartphonekey_enhances_security_for_your_property
msgid ""
