"of telecom technology, focusing on expanding connectivity solutions and "
"enhancing customer experiences. His expertise includes strategic planning, "
"market expansion, and implementing cutting-edge telecom solutions that meet "
"evolving customer needs."
msgstr ""

#. module: spk_website_v2
#: model_terms:spk.website.team.member,bio:spk_website_v2.team_kostiantyn_dolzhenko
